# grove reads no .env file. Provider tokens normally live in the system keyring (`grove login`).
# Headless override (CI, servers without a Secret Service): GROVE_TOKEN_<ID>, where <ID> is the provider
# id upper-cased with non-alphanumerics replaced by `_`. Example for a provider called "home":
# GROVE_TOKEN_HOME=
# GROVE_NO_CLI_TOKENS=1  # do not fall back to the tokens of `tea` (Gitea/Forgejo) and `gh` (GitHub)
# GROVE_BIN=            # GUI shell only: path of the grove CLI (default: `grove` from PATH)
